sequenceDiagram
  actor Operator as Lab operator
  participant Endpoint as Windows/Ubuntu/pfSense
  participant Logstash
  participant Elastic as Elasticsearch
  participant Kibana
  participant Shuffle as Shuffle webhook
  participant Worker as Shuffle worker/app
  Operator->>Endpoint: Run authorized Atomic test
  Endpoint->>Logstash: Event via Beats TLS/5044
  Logstash->>Elastic: Normalize and index
  Kibana->>Elastic: Detection rule query
  Elastic-->>Kibana: Matching event / alert ID
  Kibana->>Shuffle: Webhook with alert payload
  Shuffle->>Worker: Start workflow execution
  Worker-->>Shuffle: Action result SUCCESS
  Shuffle-->>Kibana: HTTP acknowledgement
  Note over Kibana,Shuffle: Evidence maps alert ID to execution ID
